==Battleground==
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 4~6.67 seconds<sup>120f~200f</sup>.
*2 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*2 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 10.67~18 seconds<sup>320f~540f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 24 seconds<sup>720f</sup>, delay 5.33~13.33 seconds<sup>160f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 29.33 seconds<sup>880f</sup>, delay 20~24 seconds<sup>600f~720f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Possessed King Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 6~16 seconds<sup>180f~480f</sup>.
**5 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 12~15.33 seconds<sup>360f~460f</sup>.
**4 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 14~18 seconds<sup>420f~540f</sup>.
**3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16~20 seconds<sup>480f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Despite Possessed King Doge's multi hit, and the ability to [[Freeze]] Cat units, its awful HP essentially means this is just a [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] fight but with tankier peons, none of which should pose a problem, especially if your units are level 20.

